-     block *before* the relocation loop.  IFUNC resolvers fired during phase 2
-     of the per-object two-phase scheme therefore observe initialised TLS.  */
+  /* Populate startup TLS before relocation runs resolvers. */
@@ -2262,15 +2321 @@
-    {
